          "text": "Description: On October 20, 1986, around 8 PM, a witness walking down the street observed a rectangular flying object. The front of the object is rounded with a white light and the back ends in a triangle. Under the gray metallic craft, the witness saw a red light and two green lights. The movement is slow, silent, and at an altitude of approximately 200 meters. No further information was gathered.",
